          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.27.30+LEV.27.31+LEV.27.32+LEV.27.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 27:30–33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tengani mafungu ga kumi ga mavuno gosi ga minda yenu chila mwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu mphiye phatu ambapho Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu akaphatsambula phakale makaloge, na hipho mbereze mundarya mafungu ga kumi ga mitsere yenu, ga uchi wa zabibu zenu, ga mafuha, ga ana a mwandzo a ngʼombe na a mangʼondzi genu. Muhende hivi kusudi mdzifundze kumuogopha Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu chila wakati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichikala pho phatu pha ibada ambapho Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, akaphatsambula ni kure sana namwi tamuweza kutsukula mafungu ga kumi ga mavuno genu ambago Mwenyezi Mlungu akakujaliyani kuphaha, phahi, mundahenda hivi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaguza mavuno genu na kuphirika pesa hizo hadi phatu Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, ariphotsambula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundahumira hizo pesa kugula chochosi mndichomendza ikale ni ngʼombe, ngʼondzi, uchi wa zabibu au uchi mufu. Mundavirya na kuhererwa hipho mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, phamwenga na jamaa zenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Msiyale Alawi anaoishi kahi yenu; aho taana fungu wala urisi wao kahi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila mwisho wa mwaka wa hahu lavyani mafungu ga kumi ga mavuno genu gosi na kugaika akiba kpwenye midzi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo indakala kpwa ajili ya Alawi, (kpwa sababu taana fungu wala urisi kahi yenu) ajeni, anachiya na magungu ambao anaishi kpwenye midzi yenu, ili edze arye na kushiba. Hendani hivi ili Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, ajaliye kazi zenu zosi muhendazo na mikono yenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
